WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.200
Do you have an idea you want to explore?

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.400
Landscape looks for companies already doing it.

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.600
There is one box and one question.

4
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.000
You type the idea in ordinary words.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.800
Then press Analyse. That is the only step.

6
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.600
It reads public web pages. This takes about two minutes.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:31.000
Each page appears as it is read.

8
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.800
Company sites, a forum, and one page it could not open.

9
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:42.200
It read the idea as ordering software for small farms.

10
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:47.600
Three companies matched that reading. The report is built on it.

11
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:54.000
If that reading is wrong, change reopens it.

12
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.800
You correct the wording and it runs again.

13
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:04.400
The report follows. What they charge is next.
